# kelpie — thin coordinator (olympus/geode pattern: metadata + bin + docs only)
# Kitchen-sink: products/ are peer standalone repos, referenced-not-owned.
*
!.gitignore
!README.md
!LICENSE
!package.json
!mise.toml
!AGENTS.md
!bin/
!bin/**
!docs/
!docs/**

# Keys & secrets — never commit
*.key
*.pem
*.p12
*.pfx
*.jks
*.keystore
*.keyring
*.secret
.env
.env.*
!*.example
